Package: nlmixr2qual
Title: Qualification Suite for nlmixr2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Justin", "Wilkins", , "justin.wilkins@occams.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducibility qualification of an nlmixr2 installation.
    References are known-good fits imported from 'nlmixr2save' bundles and
    stored as self-contained JSON, each tagged with the thread count that
    produced it. Qualifying an install re-fits each reference locally, at
    its own thread count, and compares the result against the stored
    reference within tolerance, rendering a Quarto summary with an overall
    PASS/FAIL verdict.
